   "piezas": [
    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "The object before the verb",
     "texto": [
      "In **把 + object + verb**, the object comes before the verb because it highlights what is done to it. It usually indicates a result, a change or a place: 把房间整理好 = to leave the room tidy.",
      "In English the object usually comes after the verb: «tidy the room». In Chinese, 把 announces that an action will be applied to that object."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    },
